eel propane or diesel truck. And when those aren't available, you\u2019ll have to make do with the good old pallet jack. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extreme Forklifting 3, the game you never knew you wanted!</p>","developers":["DevM Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172570/header.jpg?t=1773239478","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3172570/709195747/2f4f06f95019a24ad6b4bc29246c15fd2cab3aa8/1773238686/dash_av1.mpd?t=1773239476","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3172570/709195747/2f4f06f95019a24ad6b4bc29246c15fd2cab3aa8/1773238686/dash_h264.mpd?t=1773239476","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3172570/709195747/2f4f06f95019a24ad6b4bc29246c15fd2cab3aa8/1773238686/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1773239476","id":257301549,"name":"Extreme Forklifting 3 - Release Date Announcement","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257301549/6807760af0f17019b3466923350b9cc0aaf6083d/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1773239476"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3172570/2064086351/994e3d930f65280606706eeafcf467a236705991/1760023916/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760025350","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3172570/2064086351/994e3d930f65280606706eeafcf467a236705991/1760023916/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760025350","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3172570/2064086351/994e3d930f65280606706eeafcf467a236705991/1760023916/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760025350","id":257214911,"name":"Extreme Forklifting 3 - 2025 trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/st